1
00:00:12,336 --> 00:00:17,828
Je suis fatiguée. Je travaille trop en ce moment.
I'm tired. I work too much at the moment.

2
00:00:17,928 --> 00:00:21,668
Tu devrais prendre quelques jours de repos.
You should take a few days of rest.

3
00:00:21,768 --> 00:00:27,332
Mais j'ai beaucoup de travail. Que ferais-tu à ma place ?
But I have a lot of work. What would you do in my place?

4
00:00:27,432 --> 00:00:31,796
À ta place, j'en parlerais à mon chef.
In your place, I would talk to my boss about it.

5
00:00:31,896 --> 00:00:37,988
Tu as raison. Il vaudrait mieux parler maintenant que trop tard.
You're right. It would be better to speak now than too late.

6
00:00:38,088 --> 00:00:43,772
Voilà. Et tu pourrais aussi marcher un peu chaque soir.
There you go. And you could also walk a little each evening.
